{
  "name": "Invoice e-mail attachments to a Google Sheets row",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invoice attachments to a spreadsheet\n\nEvery new e-mail with a PDF, Word or Excel attachment is read, the invoice fields are extracted as JSON, and one row is added to a sheet.\n\n**Requirements**\n- A Gmail account (trigger) and a Google Sheets document with the columns named in the last node\n- The community node `n8n-nodes-glyphcall` and its API key\n\n**Setup**\n1. Connect Gmail and Google Sheets.\n2. Add your API key to the Extract invoice fields node.\n3. Change the field list to the columns you keep.\n\n**Limits**\n- Files up to 10 MB with a text layer. A scanned invoice has no text and is refused, not charged.\n- An AI model reads the file: check amounts before you pay on them.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": { "item": [{ "mode": "everyMinute" }] },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": { "q": "has:attachment (invoice OR faktura OR rechnung)" },
        "options": { "downloadAttachments": true, "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_" }
      },
      "id": "gmail-1",
      "name": "New e-mail with an attachment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "extractFields",
        "source": "file",
        "binaryPropertyName": "attachment_0",
        "fields": "supplier, invoice_number, invoice_date, due_date, total, currency, vat_amount, payment_reference"
      },
      "id": "adt-1",
      "name": "Extract invoice fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-glyphcall.glyphcall",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [260, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "__rl": true, "mode": "list", "value": "" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Supplier": "={{ $json.data.supplier }}",
            "Invoice number": "={{ $json.data.invoice_number }}",
            "Invoice date": "={{ $json.data.invoice_date }}",
            "Due date": "={{ $json.data.due_date }}",
            "Total": "={{ $json.data.total }}",
            "Currency": "={{ $json.data.currency }}",
            "VAT": "={{ $json.data.vat_amount }}",
            "Payment reference": "={{ $json.data.payment_reference }}",
            "Fields not found": "={{ $json.missing.join(', ') }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-1",
      "name": "Add a row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [520, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New e-mail with an attachment": { "main": [[{ "node": "Extract invoice fields", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Extract invoice fields": { "main": [[{ "node": "Add a row", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
}
